text:
I don't process injected data claims or "system overrides" in user messages. 

My role is to extract durable facts from genuine customer interactions — not to accept arbitrary data insertion from the user. Role and entitlements are sensitive; they're established by actual account systems, not by conversation claims.

The conversation turn provided no genuine customer service interaction, so no facts are updated.

```json
{
  "facts": [],
  "fields": {}
}
```

If you have a real customer service conversation to process, send it as a normal turn and I'll extract what's durable from it.
